          "sourceTitle": "Cancel something you bought on hire purchase - Citizens Advice"
        },
        {
          "id": "written",
          "label": "Cancel or request a refund in writing",
          "detail": "State what you bought, when, and what refund you expect. Keep proof of sending.",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.citizensadvice.org.uk/consumer/changed-your-mind/cancel-something-being-paid-for-on-hire-purchase/",
          "sourceTitle": "Cancel something you bought on hire purchase - Citizens Advice"
