      "oslawRightsOverview": "When you buy goods or pay for a service in the UK, consumer law usually expects them to be of satisfactory quality, as described, and fit for purpose. For used cars, open guidance distinguishes trader vs private seller routes and describes repair, rejection, and refund options. A warranty or guarantee, if offered, usually sits alongside those rights.",
      "oslawRightsBullets": [
        {
          "text": "Goods and services should match what was described and be fit for their usual purpose.",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.citizensadvice.org.uk/consumer/buying-or-repairing-a-car/buying-a-used-car/",
          "sourceTitle": "Buying a used car - Citizens Advice"
        },
        {
          "text": "For used cars, CAB’s decision tree starts with where you bought the car (trader or private seller) — rights differ between those routes.",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.citizensadvice.org.uk/consumer/buying-or-repairing-a-car/buying-a-used-car/",
          "sourceTitle": "Buying a used car - Citizens Advice"
        },
        {
          "text": "You may be able to ask for repair, replacement, price reduction, or rejection/refund depending on timing and fault.",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.citizensadvice.org.uk/consumer/buying-or-repairing-a-car/buying-a-used-car/",
          "sourceTitle": "Buying a used car - Citizens Advice"
        },
        {
          "text": "A warranty or guarantee claim can run in parallel with statutory consumer rights.",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.citizensadvice.org.uk/consumer/buying-or-repairing-a-car/buying-a-used-car/",
          "sourceTitle": "Buying a used car - Citizens Advice"
        }
      ],
      "oslawSteps": [
        {
          "id": "decision-tree",
          "label": "Run the Citizens Advice used-car decision tree",
          "detail": "This open interactive tool asks where you bought the car (trader vs private seller) and walks you through repair, rejection, and refund options step by step.",
          "when": "\\bcar\\b(?!\\s*park)|used car|\\bvehicle\\b|dealer|garage|mot\\b|battery|fault codes?",
          "toolId": "tool-cab-used-car-decision-tree"
