          "detail": "Open guidance covers repair, replacement, and short-term rejection rights under consumer law.",
          "when": "^(?!.*\\b(car|vehicle|dealer|garage|battery|mot)\\b)",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.citizensadvice.org.uk/consumer/somethings-gone-wrong-with-a-purchase/claim-using-a-warranty-or-guarantee/",
          "sourceTitle": "Claim using a warranty or guarantee - Citizens Advice"
        },
        {
          "id": "warranty",
          "label": "If a warranty or guarantee was offered, follow that route too",
          "detail": "Warranty claims sit alongside statutory rights — check deadlines, what is covered, and how to claim.",
